<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced powerchip -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.label>高级能量芯片</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.label>
  <!-- EN: A rune-etched powerchip brimming with bound aether.. It is necessary to produce certain advanced constructs and equipment.\n\nAn artificer can study this chip to help unlock higher tiers of construct tech research. -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.description>一枚刻有符文、充盈束缚以太的能量芯片。它是生产某些高级构装体与装备所必需的。\n\n机巧师可以研究该芯片，以解锁更高等级的构装体技术研究。</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.description>
  <!-- EN: Analyze the advanced powerchip. -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>分析高级能量芯片。</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Analyze... -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>分析...</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: By studying the advanced powerchip, {PAWN_labelShort} has acquired the insight needed for the research project(s) {RESEARCH}.\n\nYour researchers can now use research benches to begin researching how to actually use the technology. -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>{PAWN_labelShort}通过研究高级能量芯片，获得了开展研究项目{RESEARCH}所需的洞见。\n\n你的研究者现在可以在研究台上开始研究如何实际运用该技术。</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>
  <!-- EN: Advanced powerchip studied: {RESEARCH} unlocked -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>高级能量芯片研究完成：解锁{RESEARCH}</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should analyze this -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>选择由谁来分析</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Can be analyzed by a colonist. -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>可由殖民者分析。</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Analyze advanced powerchip -->
  <VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.jobString>分析高级能量芯片</VR_PowerchipAdvanced.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.jobString>
  
